{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"rg -n 'slice.?4|P2|answer-text|checked-part|a-found-answer-with-an-extra-key-is-absent|answering-runtime' docs/design/datom.world.md collab/1790500930000-vm-engineer-dao-stream-remote-slice4-fixes.glm-flash.report.md src test\"","aggregated_output":"collab/1790500930000-vm-engineer-dao-stream-remote-slice4-fixes.glm-flash.report.md:1:## P2 fix — exact reply envelope\ncollab/1790500930000-vm-engineer-dao-stream-remote-slice4-fixes.glm-flash.report.md:3:`/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld/src/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1170` (`answer-text`, check at lines 1178-1179): the acceptance predicate now requires the exact key set, present and no extras, in addition to the existing `:jing/found?` true and `:jing/bytes` string checks:\ncollab/1790500930000-vm-engineer-dao-stream-remote-slice4-fixes.glm-flash.report.md:10:This matches the old linker's exact-envelope rule (`presence-envelope?` at HEAD) and the stepped client's `get-answer?` at `src/cljc/dao/jing/content/step.cljc:327-333`. An answer with an extra key now yields the `missing` sentinel, which `checked-part` (linker.cljc:1281-1282) refuses as `:absent` — the malformed reply can no longer flip from `:absent` to a successful link. The docstring (lines 1171-1177) names the exact shape.\ncollab/1790500930000-vm-engineer-dao-stream-remote-slice4-fixes.glm-flash.report.md:15:- `answering-runtime` helper at line 487: a runtime shaped like `local-runtime` whose drive answers each raw request with a test-supplied envelope, so hostile replies ride the same medium as honest ones.\ncollab/1790500930000-vm-engineer-dao-stream-remote-slice4-fixes.glm-flash.report.md:16:- `a-found-answer-with-an-extra-key-is-absent` at line 814, over all four formats: a found answer carrying an extra `:value` key (the old wire's key) pins `{:status :refused, :reason :absent, :address ...}` (line 835); the exact three-key shape on the same medium still links (`linker/ok?`, line 841).\ntest/dao/jing/file_test.cljc:6:   observer or pool appears here: the pool drains in file_test are P2's.\"\ntest/yin/vm/linker_test.cljc:487:(defn answering-runtime\ntest/yin/vm/linker_test.cljc:814:(deftest a-found-answer-with-an-extra-key-is-absent\ntest/yin/vm/linker_test.cljc:835:                 (answering-runtime opts #(reply true %))\ntest/yin/vm/linker_test.cljc:841:                (answering-runtime opts #(reply false %))\ntest/yin/vm/debruijn_code_test.cljc:183:;; P2-2: closes the coverage gap P1-1 survived through -- no test had ever\ntest/yin/vm/debruijn_code_test.cljc:218:            to the nearest double (debruijn-b1-fix P2-1), pinning host-double?\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:922:  (testing \"P2-5: a medium gap before any observed renewal leaves the lease unknown\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1065:  (testing \"P2-1: a throwing reclaim is \\\"did not report\\\", not a lost pass\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1129:  (testing \"P2-6: inventory whose reclaim fails is reported, not skipped\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1150:  (testing \"P2-6: a throwing inventory reclaim counts as did-not-report\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1156:  (testing \"P2-6: the stale queue is cleared and its disposition recorded\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1168:  (testing \"P2-6: :seen survives, so an old self-authored grant cannot re-seed\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1348:  (testing \"P2-8: a persistent tick error still drains every fact cursor\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1625:  (testing \"P2-2: a rejected grant is counted once and leaves the queue\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1657:  (testing \"P2-3: a hook handing back a :lapsed fact is refused\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:1866:    ;; demands the explicit value (r4-P2)\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2264:  (testing \"P2: the granted duration, not the ask, sizes the interval\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2282:  (testing \"P2: equality is the violation; one past is sized\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2294:  (testing \"P2: a subject expectation refuses the wrong resource's grant\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2309:  (testing \"P2: a proposal expectation matches only its own answer\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2332:  (testing \"P2: a reading without a drained tick holds nothing -- the\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2342:  (testing \"P2: the predicates answer nothing for an invalid reading\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2352:  (testing \"P2: the interval gets the tolerance's checks (N4/R3 parity)\"\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2369:  (testing \"P2: renewal-interval overflows as an assembly ex-info, never a\ntest/dao/lease_test.cljc:2383:  (testing \"P2: a second stop returns no second release\"\ntest/dao/lease_composition_test.cljc:684:    ;; :attribution :envelope-key means (r4-P2: the earlier sketch\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1170:(defn- answer-text\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1271:(defn- checked-part\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1633:        res (checked-part record (:identity link) address text\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1671:   exactly as a reply that carried no payload does (checked-part's\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/linker.cljc:1679:                    id (answer-text (:answer entry)))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
